{"page":505,"verses":[{"verse_key":"46:21","surah":46,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَٱذْكُرْ أَخَا عَادٍ إِذْ أَنذَرَ قَوْمَهُۥ بِٱلْأَحْقَافِ وَقَدْ خَلَتِ ٱلنُّذُرُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ يَدَيْهِ وَمِنْ خَلْفِهِۦٓ أَلَّا تَعْبُدُوٓا۟ إِلَّا ٱللَّهَ إِنِّىٓ أَخَافُ عَلَيْكُمْ عَذَابَ يَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Mention [Hud] of the tribe of Ad: he warned his people among the sand dunes- other warners have come and gone both before and after him- ‘ Worship no one but God: I fear for you, that you will be punished on a terrible Day,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَٱذْكُرْ","en_gloss":"And mention","transliteration":"wa-udh'kur","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَخَا","en_gloss":"(the) brother","transliteration":"akhā","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَادٍ","en_gloss":"(of) Aad","transliteration":"ʿādin","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنذَرَ","en_gloss":"he warned","transliteration":"andhara","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَوْمَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his people","transliteration":"qawmahu","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْأَحْقَافِ","en_gloss":"in the Al-Ahqaf ","transliteration":"bil-aḥqāfi","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَقَدْ","en_gloss":"and had already passed away","transliteration":"waqad","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"خَلَتِ","en_gloss":"and had already passed away","transliteration":"khalati","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنُّذُرُ","en_gloss":"[the] warners","transliteration":"l-nudhuru","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"before him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَيْنِ","en_gloss":"before him","transliteration":"bayni","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَدَيْهِ","en_gloss":"before him","transliteration":"yadayhi","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"and after him","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":15,"ar":"خَلْفِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"and after him","transliteration":"khalfihi","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"That not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَعْبُدُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"you worship","transliteration":"taʿbudū","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":20,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أَخَافُ","en_gloss":"[I] fear","transliteration":"akhāfu","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":22,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":23,"ar":"عَذَابَ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يَوْمٍ","en_gloss":"(of) a Day","transliteration":"yawmin","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":25,"ar":"عَظِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"Great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","verse_key":"46:21"},{"pos":26,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:21"}]},{"verse_key":"46:22","surah":46,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟ أَجِئْتَنَا لِتَأْفِكَنَا عَنْ ءَالِهَتِنَا فَأْتِنَا بِمَا تَعِدُنَآ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but they said, ‘Have you come to turn us away from our gods? If what you say is true, bring down that punishment you threaten us with!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَجِئْتَنَا","en_gloss":"Have you come to us","transliteration":"aji'tanā","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِتَأْفِكَنَا","en_gloss":"to turn us away","transliteration":"litafikanā","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَالِهَتِنَا","en_gloss":"our gods","transliteration":"ālihatinā","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأْتِنَا","en_gloss":"Then bring us","transliteration":"fatinā","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَعِدُنَآ","en_gloss":"you threaten us","transliteration":"taʿidunā","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the truthful","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqīna","verse_key":"46:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:22"}]},{"verse_key":"46:23","surah":46,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ إِنَّمَا ٱلْعِلْمُ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ وَأُبَلِّغُكُم مَّآ أُرْسِلْتُ بِهِۦ وَلَـٰكِنِّىٓ أَرَىٰكُمْ قَوْمًا تَجْهَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He said, ‘Only God knows when it will come: I simply convey to you the message I am sent with but I can see you are an insolent people.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْعِلْمُ","en_gloss":"the knowledge","transliteration":"l-ʿil'mu","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"(is) with Allah","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(is) with Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأُبَلِّغُكُم","en_gloss":"and I convey to you","transliteration":"wa-uballighukum","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَّآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُرْسِلْتُ","en_gloss":"I am sent","transliteration":"ur'sil'tu","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinnī","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَرَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"I see you","transliteration":"arākum","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَجْهَلُونَ","en_gloss":"ignorant","transliteration":"tajhalūna","verse_key":"46:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:23"}]},{"verse_key":"46:24","surah":46,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا رَأَوْهُ عَارِضًا مُّسْتَقْبِلَ أَوْدِيَتِهِمْ قَالُوا۟ هَـٰذَا عَارِضٌ مُّمْطِرُنَا ۚ بَلْ هُوَ مَا ٱسْتَعْجَلْتُم بِهِۦ ۖ رِيحٌ فِيهَا عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When they saw a cloud approaching their valley, they said, ‘This cloud will give us rain!’ ‘No indeed! It is what you wanted to hasten: a storm-wind bearing a painful punishment","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَأَوْهُ","en_gloss":"they saw it","transliteration":"ra-awhu","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَارِضًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a cloud","transliteration":"ʿāriḍan","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُّسْتَقْبِلَ","en_gloss":"approaching","transliteration":"mus'taqbila","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوْدِيَتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their valleys","transliteration":"awdiyatihim","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَارِضٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a cloud","transliteration":"ʿāriḍun","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُّمْطِرُنَا ۚ","en_gloss":"bringing us rain","transliteration":"mum'ṭirunā","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱسْتَعْجَلْتُم","en_gloss":"you were asking it to be hastened","transliteration":"is'taʿjaltum","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"you were asking it to be hastened","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"رِيحٌۭ","en_gloss":"a wind","transliteration":"rīḥun","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmun","verse_key":"46:24"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:24"}]},{"verse_key":"46:25","surah":46,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"تُدَمِّرُ كُلَّ شَىْءٍۭ بِأَمْرِ رَبِّهَا فَأَصْبَحُوا۟ لَا يُرَىٰٓ إِلَّا مَسَـٰكِنُهُمْ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نَجْزِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"which will destroy everything by its Lord’s command.’ In the morning there was nothing to see except their [ruined] dwellings: this is how We repay the guilty.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"تُدَمِّرُ","en_gloss":"Destroying","transliteration":"tudammiru","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"شَىْءٍۭ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِأَمْرِ","en_gloss":"by (the) command","transliteration":"bi-amri","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبِّهَا","en_gloss":"(of) its Lord","transliteration":"rabbihā","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","en_gloss":"Then they became (such)","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥū","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُرَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"is seen","transliteration":"yurā","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَسَـٰكِنُهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their dwellings","transliteration":"masākinuhum","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَجْزِى","en_gloss":"We recompense","transliteration":"najzī","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawma","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","en_gloss":"[the] criminals","transliteration":"l-muj'rimīna","verse_key":"46:25"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:25"}]},{"verse_key":"46:26","surah":46,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ مَكَّنَّـٰهُمْ فِيمَآ إِن مَّكَّنَّـٰكُمْ فِيهِ وَجَعَلْنَا لَهُمْ سَمْعًا وَأَبْصَـٰرًا وَأَفْـِٔدَةً فَمَآ أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُمْ سَمْعُهُمْ وَلَآ أَبْصَـٰرُهُمْ وَلَآ أَفْـِٔدَتُهُم مِّن شَىْءٍ إِذْ كَانُوا۟ يَجْحَدُونَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَحَاقَ بِهِم مَّا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We had established them in a way we have not established you [people of Mecca]; We gave them hearing, sight, and hearts, yet their hearing, sight, and hearts were of no use to them, since they denied God’s revelations. They were overwhelmed by the punishment they had mocked.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"46:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَكَّنَّـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We had established them","transliteration":"makkannāhum","verse_key":"46:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِيمَآ","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"46:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"46:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَّكَّنَّـٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"We have established you","transliteration":"makkannākum","verse_key":"46:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"46:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"46:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","trans